error[E0200|typecheck]: associated function `with_capacity` is not available on `HashMap<String, i32>`; the capacity/bulk group (`with_capacity`, `capacity`, `reserve`, `try_reserve`, `shrink_to_fit`, `clear`, `drain`, `remove_entry`, `extend`) is implemented only for the flat `HashMap<i32, i32>` store; this pair supports `len`, `is_empty`, `insert`, `get`, `contains_key`, `remove`, `keys`, `values`, and `entries`.
